y` — `apiKe"},{"id":"p5s8","text":"y` / `apiKeyEnv` / `baseURL` / `maxResults`\n- `web-search` — `backend` selection (`tavily` | `deepse"},{"id":"p5s9","text":"nv` / `baseURL` / `maxResults`\n- `web-search` — `backend` selection (`tavily` | `deepseek-official`)"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Restart `dsh web` after installing (bundle layers are frozen at boot). To uninstall: `dsh plugin --p"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"rofile web remove dsh-web-search-tavily`."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### 1. Credential"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Store your Tavily key in `$DSH_HOME/.credentials.yaml`:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### 2. Backend selection"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The `web` row's `searchProvider` is set to `search-switch` (the delegating provider) by this bundle."},{"id":"p14s2","text":" The active backend lives in the `web-search` section of `$DSH_HOME/settings.yaml` and **hot-reloads"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" backend lives in the `web-search` section of `$DSH_HOME/settings.yaml` and **hot-reloads on save**:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- `tavily` — this plugin's Tavily provider (results carry content excerpts)\n- `deepseek-official` — "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"delegates to the shipped `web-search-deepseek` provider (DeepSeek Anthropic-compatible Messages endp"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"hipped `web-search-deepseek` provider (DeepSeek Anthropic-compatible Messages endpoint; no excerpts)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### 3. Tavily options (`web-search-tavily` section)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Field | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| `apiKey` | none | Literal key (secret, stored via the credentials domain) |\n| `apiKeyEnv` | `TAVIL"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"Y_API_KEY` | Credential reference name |\n| `baseURL` | `https://api.tavily.com` | Tavily REST endpoi"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"nt |\n| `maxResults` | `5` | Max results per search |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Why a delegating provider instead of editing the `web` row directly? Changing the `web` row's config"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" **restarts the dsh-web plugin and disposes every registered provider** (Cordis `Fiber.update → rest"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"art` semantics). The switcher keeps the selection in the settings layer only, sidestepping that haza"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"cs). The switcher keeps the selection in the settings layer only, sidestepping that hazard entirely."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
